<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta content='text/html; charset=UTF-8' http-equiv='Content-Type' />
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #000;
      background-color: #fff;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid #000;
    }
    .header {
      background: #000;
      padding: 50px 40px;
      text-align: center;
      color: white;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    }
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 300;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .header .tagline {
      margin: 15px 0 0;
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      opacity: 0.9;
      font-weight: 300;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 50px 40px;
      background: #fff;
    }
    .content p {
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      color: #000;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }
    .button-container {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 40px 0;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 18px 50px;
      background: #000;
      color: white !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }
    .button:hover {
      background: #333;
    }
    .footer {
      background: #f8f9fa;
      padding: 40px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #666;
      border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }
    .footer strong {
      color: #000;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }
    .disclaimer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding-top: 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #999;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Gerold & Partners</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Executive Search & Advisory</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Thank you for subscribing to our newsletter.</p>
      <p>To complete your subscription and start receiving exclusive updates on new opportunities and industry insights, please confirm your email address by clicking the button below:</p>
      <div class="button-container">
        <a href="<%= @confirmation_url %>" class="button">Confirm Subscription</a>
      </div>
      <p class="disclaimer" style="font-size: 14px; color: #999; margin-top: 40px; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; padding-top: 20px;">
        If you did not subscribe to this newsletter, you may safely ignore this email.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p><strong>Gerold & Partners</strong><br>
      Executive Search & Advisory</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 15px;">contact@geroldpartners.com</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
